  <h2 id="about">1. About Bharat Business Index</h2>
  <p>Bharat Business Index ("BBI", "we", "us", or "our") is an independent business ranking platform that evaluates and ranks businesses across various categories and cities in India. Our platform is accessible at <strong>bharatbusinessindex.com</strong> and provides rankings, business profiles, and related editorial content.</p>
  <p>BBI operates as a ranking and information platform. We aggregate publicly available data, customer reviews, and editorial assessments to produce business rankings across multiple categories and Indian cities. Our rankings are updated monthly using a transparent, documented methodology.</p>
  <p>This Privacy Policy explains how we collect, use, disclose, and safeguard your information when you visit our website. Please read this privacy policy carefully. If you do not agree with the terms of this privacy policy, please do not access the site.</p>

  <h2 id="disclaimer">2. Important Disclaimer — Rankings & Recommendations</h2>
  
  <blockquote>
    <strong>BBI rankings are for informational purposes only.</strong> We rank businesses based on our proprietary methodology, but we do not guarantee, warrant, or certify the quality, reliability, safety, or suitability of any ranked business. A high ranking does not constitute an endorsement, recommendation, or guarantee that a business will meet your specific needs or expectations.
  </blockquote>

  <p>Our rankings are compiled using a combination of data sources including publicly available customer reviews, review volume, online presence, business verification status, profile completeness, and editorial assessment. While we strive to be accurate and fair, please understand the following:</p>

  <ul>
    <li><strong>No guarantee of quality:</strong> A top-ranked business may not necessarily provide the best service for your particular needs. Rankings reflect aggregated data and our methodology — they are not personal recommendations.</li>
    <li><strong>No guarantee of accuracy:</strong> While we make every reasonable effort to verify information, business details such as addresses, phone numbers, ratings, and service descriptions may change without notice. We cannot guarantee that all information displayed on our platform is current or complete at all times.</li>
    <li><strong>No guarantee of outcomes:</strong> Using a business ranked on BBI does not guarantee satisfaction, safety, or any specific outcome. You should always conduct your own due diligence before engaging any service provider.</li>
    <li><strong>Rankings may change:</strong> Rankings are recalculated monthly. A business that is ranked #1 today may move to a different position in subsequent months based on new data. Past rankings do not guarantee future performance.</li>
    <li><strong>Subjective elements:</strong> Our methodology includes editorial assessment, which involves subjective judgment by our team. Different evaluation frameworks could yield different results.</li>
  </ul>

  <p>By using our platform, you acknowledge that you understand these limitations and agree not to hold BBI responsible for any decisions made based on our rankings.</p>

  <h2 id="no-promotion">3. No Promotion or Endorsement</h2>

  <p><strong>BBI does not promote businesses.</strong> Our platform is strictly a ranking and information service. We want to be very clear about the following:</p>

  <ul>
    <li>We are <strong>not</strong> an advertising platform. Rankings cannot be purchased or influenced through payments.</li>
    <li>We are <strong>not</strong> an affiliate marketing service. We do not earn commissions from businesses ranked on our platform.</li>
    <li>We are <strong>not</strong> a promotional agency. We do not run marketing campaigns for any business.</li>
    <li>While we offer "Sponsored" listings that are clearly labeled, sponsored status <strong>never affects</strong> a business's ranking position. Sponsored listings are visually distinguished and do not receive any ranking benefit.</li>
    <li>BBI "Verified" status indicates that we have independently confirmed a business's basic information — it is not an endorsement of quality or service.</li>
  </ul>

  <p>Our goal is to provide transparent, independent information to help consumers make informed decisions. We maintain strict editorial independence and our ranking methodology is publicly documented on our <a href="/methodology" style="color:var(--navy);font-weight:600">Methodology</a> page.</p>

  <h2 id="methodology">4. Ranking Methodology Limitations</h2>

  <p>Our ranking algorithm evaluates businesses across six categories: Customer Reviews (35%), Review Volume (25%), Website & Online Presence (15%), Verification Status (10%), Profile Completeness (10%), and Editorial Assessment (15%). While this methodology is designed to be fair and comprehensive, it has inherent limitations:</p>

  <ul>
    <li><strong>Data dependency:</strong> Our rankings rely heavily on third-party review platforms (primarily Google Reviews). The accuracy of our rankings is therefore dependent on the accuracy and authenticity of these reviews.</li>
    <li><strong>Volume bias:</strong> Businesses with more reviews tend to score higher. Newer businesses or those in niche markets may be disadvantaged regardless of their actual quality.</li>
    <li><strong>Geographic limitations:</strong> Our coverage varies by city. Not all businesses in a given category or city may be represented in our rankings.</li>
    <li><strong>Category limitations:</strong> Business categories are broad groupings. A business may span multiple categories but will typically be ranked in only one.</li>
    <li><strong>Temporal limitations:</strong> Rankings are updated monthly. A business that has recently improved or declined may not be immediately reflected in rankings.</li>
  </ul>

  <p>We continuously work to improve our methodology and expand our coverage. For full details, please visit our <a href="/methodology" style="color:var(--navy);font-weight:600">Methodology</a> page.</p>

  <h2 id="info-collect">5. Information We Collect</h2>

  <h3>Information You Provide</h3>
  <p>When you interact with our platform, we may collect information that you voluntarily provide, including:</p>
  <ul>
    <li><strong>Get Listed submissions:</strong> Business name, contact name, email, phone number, website, city, category, and business description.</li>
    <li><strong>Claim requests:</strong> Contact name, email, phone number, and verification details when you claim a business listing.</li>
    <li><strong>Search queries:</strong> Terms you enter in our search functionality.</li>
  </ul>

  <h3>Information Collected Automatically</h3>
  <p>When you access our website, we may automatically collect certain information, including:</p>
  <ul>
    <li>Browser type and version</li>
    <li>Operating system</li>
    <li>IP address (anonymized where possible)</li>
    <li>Pages visited and time spent on pages</li>
    <li>Referring website or link</li>
    <li>Search queries performed on our site</li>
  </ul>

  <h3>Business Data</h3>
  <p>We collect and display publicly available business information including business names, addresses, phone numbers, websites, Google ratings, and review counts. This information is aggregated from public sources and is used to compile our rankings.</p>

  <h2 id="use-info">6. How We Use Your Information</h2>

  <p>We use the information we collect for the following purposes:</p>
  <ul>
    <li><strong>Ranking calculations:</strong> To compile and update our business rankings.</li>
    <li><strong>Platform operation:</strong> To maintain, improve, and optimize our website.</li>
    <li><strong>Communication:</strong> To respond to inquiries, process listing requests, and handle claim verification.</li>
    <li><strong>Analytics:</strong> To understand how our platform is used and to improve our services.</li>
    <li><strong>Security:</strong> To detect and prevent fraud, abuse, and unauthorized access.</li>
  </ul>

  <p>We do <strong>not</strong> sell your personal information to third parties. We do <strong>not</strong> use your information for targeted advertising. We do <strong>not</strong> share your contact information with the businesses we rank.</p>

  <h2 id="cookies">7. Cookies & Tracking</h2>

  <p>Our website uses cookies and similar technologies to enable core functionality, improve your experience, and support our services. The cookies we use include:</p>

  <h3>Essential Cookies</h3>
  <ul>
    <li><strong>Session cookies:</strong> Used to maintain your session state (e.g., admin login). These are deleted when you close your browser.</li>
    <li><strong>Security cookies:</strong> Used to prevent cross-site request forgery and other security threats.</li>
    <li><strong>Cookie consent:</strong> Used to remember your cookie preferences.</li>
  </ul>

  <h3>Analytics Cookies</h3>
  <ul>
    <li><strong>Google Analytics (GA4):</strong> We use Google Analytics to understand how visitors interact with our website — which pages are visited, how long users stay, and how they navigate between pages. Google Analytics uses cookies to collect this information anonymously. No personally identifiable information is stored. You can opt out of Google Analytics by installing the <a href="https://tools.google.com/dlpage/gaoptout" target="_blank" rel="noopener" style="color:var(--navy);font-weight:600">Google Analytics Opt-out Browser Add-on</a>.</li>
  </ul>

  <h3>Advertising Cookies</h3>
  <ul>
    <li><strong>Google AdSense:</strong> We display advertisements served by Google AdSense on our website. Google may use cookies to serve ads based on your prior visits to our website or other websites. These cookies allow Google and its partners to serve relevant advertisements. You can opt out of personalized advertising by visiting <a href="https://www.google.com/settings/ads" target="_blank" rel="noopener" style="color:var(--navy);font-weight:600">Google Ads Settings</a> or <a href="https://www.aboutads.info/choices/" target="_blank" rel="noopener" style="color:var(--navy);font-weight:600">www.aboutads.info</a>.</li>
  </ul>

  <p>When you first visit our website, you will be presented with a cookie consent banner. You may accept or decline non-essential cookies. Essential cookies cannot be disabled as they are necessary for the website to function properly.</p>

  <h2 id="advertising">8. Advertising & Third-Party Services</h2>

  <p>We display advertisements on our website through <strong>Google AdSense</strong>, a third-party advertising service operated by Google LLC. These advertisements help us maintain and improve the Bharat Business Index platform.</p>

  <p>Important clarifications regarding advertising on BBI:</p>
  <ul>
    <li><strong>Advertising does not influence rankings:</strong> Display advertisements served through Google AdSense are entirely separate from our business rankings. No advertiser can influence, purchase, or improve their ranking position through advertising.</li>
    <li><strong>Personalized vs. non-personalized ads:</strong> Depending on your cookie preferences and jurisdiction, Google may serve personalized ads based on your browsing history, or non-personalized ads based only on the page content.</li>
    <li><strong>Third-party cookies:</strong> Google and its advertising partners may place cookies on your browser to serve ads and measure their effectiveness. For more information, please review <a href="https://policies.google.com/privacy" target="_blank" rel="noopener" style="color:var(--navy);font-weight:600">Google's Privacy Policy</a>.</li>
    <li><strong>Opt-out:</strong> You can control ad personalization through your <a href="https://www.google.com/settings/ads" target="_blank" rel="noopener" style="color:var(--navy);font-weight:600">Google Ads Settings</a>, or opt out of third-party vendor cookies at <a href="https://www.aboutads.info/choices/" target="_blank" rel="noopener" style="color:var(--navy);font-weight:600">www.aboutads.info</a>.</li>
  </ul>

  <p>We also use <strong>Google Analytics</strong> to collect anonymized usage statistics. This helps us understand how our platform is used and how we can improve it. Google Analytics data is processed in accordance with <a href="https://policies.google.com/privacy" target="_blank" rel="noopener" style="color:var(--navy);font-weight:600">Google's Privacy Policy</a>.</p>

  <h2 id="sharing">9. Information Sharing</h2>

  <p>We do not sell, trade, or rent your personal information to third parties. We may share information in the following limited circumstances:</p>
  <ul>
    <li><strong>Legal requirements:</strong> If required by law, court order, or governmental regulation.</li>
    <li><strong>Protection:</strong> To protect the rights, property, or safety of BBI, our users, or the public.</li>
    <li><strong>Service providers:</strong> With trusted service providers who assist in operating our platform (e.g., web hosting), subject to confidentiality agreements.</li>
  </ul>

  <h2 id="data-security">10. Data Security</h2>

  <p>We implement appropriate technical and organizational security measures to protect your information, including:</p>
  <ul>
    <li>HTTPS encryption for all data in transit</li>
    <li>Secure session management with HTTP-only cookies</li>
    <li>Rate limiting to prevent brute-force attacks</li>
    <li>Input validation and sanitization</li>
    <li>Regular security reviews of our codebase</li>
  </ul>
  <p>However, no method of transmission over the Internet or electronic storage is 100% secure. While we strive to protect your information, we cannot guarantee absolute security.</p>

  <h2 id="business-owners">11. For Business Owners</h2>

  <p>If your business is listed on BBI:</p>
  <ul>
    <li>Your ranking is determined by our methodology and cannot be improved through payment.</li>
    <li>You can <a href="/get-listed" style="color:var(--navy);font-weight:600">submit your business</a> for consideration if it is not yet listed.</li>
    <li>You can <strong>claim your business listing</strong> to verify ownership. Claiming does not change your ranking but adds a "Claimed" badge to your profile.</li>
    <li>If you believe any information about your business is inaccurate, please contact us and we will review and update it promptly.</li>
    <li>You may request removal of your business from our rankings. While we aim to provide comprehensive coverage, we will honor removal requests from verified business owners.</li>
  </ul>

  <h2 id="user-rights">12. Your Rights</h2>

  <p>Depending on your jurisdiction, you may have the following rights regarding your personal information:</p>
  <ul>
    <li><strong>Access:</strong> You can request to know what personal information we hold about you.</li>
    <li><strong>Correction:</strong> You can request correction of inaccurate personal information.</li>
    <li><strong>Deletion:</strong> You can request deletion of your personal information, subject to legal requirements.</li>
    <li><strong>Objection:</strong> You can object to the processing of your personal information in certain circumstances.</li>
  </ul>
  <p>To exercise any of these rights, please contact us using the details provided below.</p>

  <h2 id="children">13. Children's Privacy</h2>
  <p>Our platform is not intended for use by children under the age of 18. We do not knowingly collect personal information from children. If we become aware that we have collected personal information from a child, we will take steps to delete it.</p>

  <h2 id="changes">14. Changes to This Policy</h2>
  <p>We may update this privacy policy from time to time. Changes will be posted on this page with an updated "Last updated" date. Your continued use of the platform after any modifications indicates your acceptance of the updated policy.</p>

